1
00:00:00,479 --> 00:00:03,209
(Leonard:)He's got what we need
and can meet us tonight.

2
00:00:03,215 --> 00:00:05,545
Oh, really?

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,950
You know I don't like
buying things at night.

4
00:00:09,154 --> 00:00:10,484
January 7, 2009.

5
00:00:10,489 --> 00:00:12,859
I went to the Ralph's
at 11:30pm to pick up

6
00:00:12,858 --> 00:00:14,988
Cracklin' Oat Bran for the
morning and what did I see?

7
00:00:14,993 --> 00:00:16,523
(Leonard:)The man restocking
the cereal shelves.

8
00:00:16,528 --> 00:00:18,028
(Sheldon:)That's right.
And what did he do?

9
00:00:18,029 --> 00:00:22,029
(Leonard:)He handed you the box directly
and called you Stretch.

10
00:00:22,033 --> 00:00:24,003
(shudders)

11
00:00:24,002 --> 00:00:26,702
(Sheldon:)It's like it was yesterday.

12
00:00:26,705 --> 00:00:28,975
(Leonard:)Do you want
liquid helium or not?

13
00:00:28,974 --> 00:00:30,144
(Sheldon:)Of course I do.

14
00:00:30,141 --> 00:00:32,071
(Sheldon:)I don't want that
Swedish team scooping us.

15
00:00:32,077 --> 00:00:33,877
(Leonard:)Then I'm going
to tell him we're in.

16
00:00:33,879 --> 00:00:37,049
(Sheldon:)Leonard, wait.
This is highly unethical.

17
00:00:37,048 --> 00:00:38,778
(Leonard:)We're just bending
the rules a little.

18
00:00:38,783 --> 00:00:40,883
(Leonard:)We have grant money
to do the experiment,

19
00:00:40,886 --> 00:00:43,586
(Leonard:)so we're going to spend it
on the helium we need.

20
00:00:43,588 --> 00:00:45,058
(Leonard:)It's not like when Dr. Goldfarb

21
00:00:45,056 --> 00:00:47,156
(Leonard:)claimed he bought
an electron microscope

22
00:00:47,158 --> 00:00:48,458
(Leonard:)and he was really just keeping

23
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:52,200
(Leonard:)a Russian girl
in an apartment in Van Nuys.

24
00:00:52,197 --> 00:00:56,797
(Sheldon:)Was she helping him
with his research?

25
00:00:58,904 --> 00:01:01,024
(Stuart:)Sure.

